d":"95f8ee26-db0e-11ef-8698-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"上河","place_name_jianti_auto":"上河","start_index":103,"tongjian_id":"95f8ee27-db0e-11ef-aac5-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"上河","place_name_jianti_auto":"上河","start_index":111,"tongjian_id":"95f8ee28-db0e-11ef-b2b6-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"唐","place_name_jianti_auto":"唐","start_index":120,"tongjian_id":"95f8ee29-db0e-11ef-a553-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"靈州","place_name_jianti_auto":"灵州","start_index":121,"tongjian_id":"95f8ee2a-db0e-11ef-abcd-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":125,"tongjian_id":"95f8ee2b-db0e-11ef-ae3f-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"富平縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"富平县","start_index":126,"tongjian_id":"95f8ee2c-db0e-11ef-a96a-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"漢","place_name_jianti_auto":"汉","start_index":136,"tongjian_id":"95f8ee2d-db0e-11ef-8033-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"富平","place_name_jianti_auto":"富平","start_index":137,"tongjian_id":"95f8ee2e-db0e-11ef-97c6-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"靈州","place_name_jianti_auto":"灵州","start_index":141,"tongjian_id":"95f8ee2f-db0e-11ef-9a28-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"迴樂縣","place_name_jianti_auto":"回乐县","start_index":143,"tongjian_id":"95f8ee30-db0e-11ef-96ac-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_zhang_notes":[],"note_content":"范書·帝紀作「富平上河」，西羌傳「河上」。賢曰：富平縣，屬北地郡，故城在今靈州回樂縣西南。余按水經，河水東北逕安定郡眴卷縣故城西。註曰：地理志，河水別出爲河溝，東至富平北入河，河水於此有上河之名。前漢馮參爲上河典農都尉。則上河爲是。宋白曰：唐靈州，卽漢富平縣之地。杜佑曰：漢富平，今靈州迴樂縣。應劭曰：眴，音旬日之旬。卷，音箘簬之箘。","note_content_jianti_auto":"范书·帝纪作「富平上河」，西羌传「河上」。贤曰：富平县，属北地郡，故城在今灵州回乐县西南。余按水经，河水东北迳安定郡眴卷县故城西。注曰：地理志，河水别出为河沟，东至富平北入河，河水于此有上河之名。前汉冯参为上河典农都尉。则上河为是。宋白曰：唐灵州，即汉富平县之地。杜佑曰：汉富平，今灵州回乐县。应劭曰：眴，音旬日之旬。卷，音箘簬之箘。","note_type":"hu_note","start_index":44,"tongjian_id":"95f8ee11-db0e-11ef-acea-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_chenzhu":[],"ExtRef_Children_paragraph_links":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[{"people_name":"狼莫","people_name_jianti_auto":"狼莫","start_index":0,"tongji